      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明是个性悠哉又我行我素的\n目白家千金，我与她充满挑战的日子开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d3ae252b9790e8986fa4469bca32d9c1f3cd1732b08a2e329d81a8e4b0c8e3",
