      "uid": "zhcn:56aa6ed83b2684f58daca88e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明的起跑跟进攻时机都慢了人家一步。\n不过她的尾段加速令人眼睛一亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1167cb1d42a99bfa056035a37348274df20e8a067bf49289e8b1ad14f258ed84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
