      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅如此，纵然她个性悠哉却有远大的志向。\n她说“总有一天要成为目白家的新光芒”，\n最终她将会蜕变成什么模样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8a06dffabcd747312ac97987f3578ed9d06a20af81079d94a03fed4530ba9f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
