      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我们向目白赖恩请教\n关于比赛进程的建议。她也答应担任教练，\n分享自己过去的经验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f20da52c5a269910e55d4ad9251534da143fdd8a42905c99c8e12ff9fea74782",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
