    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2aa137104df2a17c3a18bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，目白赖恩邀请艾尼斯风神\n来担任目白光明的并跑练习对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bab9872ffc1d8076068b922af3a32140de3f53538e25250681a599a900e0fb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
