    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b0229189a8fd602840587a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神能以自己的步调控制比赛，希望这次练跑\n能让目白光明掌握尾段加速与进攻的时机──\n她要努力向两位“姐姐”学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "059fd2bec06bd0fbee1f6a0c65d146997c76523efe86021c8afa9943d8af22c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
