    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f9ecba8dec04bc65c362049",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新时代到来，比赛开始越来越看重速度。\n目白家一直以来皆较重视综合实力，\n而今天她们彻底地探讨了目白家的未来方针。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb63b88c84c628d009a2e078a4445dd1dfdc6b26b0fdb226cb4c8f45565b8fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074404.json",
      "json_path": [
